	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"『デジモンアドベンチャー』より、アニメ設定を元に立体化したFigure-rise Standardシリーズとして「ウォーグレイモン」が第１弾で登場！",
			"• 背中のブレイブシールドは左右に開閉可能。",
			"• 各関節パーツが広範囲に可動。劇中の様々なアクションポーズが再現できる。",
			"• 組み立てるだけで満足できるパーツ分割。"
		],
		"en": [
			"From \"Digimon Adventure\", \"War Greymon\" is the first in the Figure-rise Standard series, which is three-dimensional based on the anime setting!",
			"• Brave Seal on the back can be opened and closed to the left and right.",
			"• Each joint part can move over a wide range. Various action poses from the movie can be reproduced.",
			"• Part division that can be satisfied just by assembling."
		]
